  "term": "harem",
  "definition": "In this context, a harem is a social group found in a polygynous species that is contrasted with a male-biased bachelor group and includes females living together. The packet describes harem groups as showing less intense aggression than bachelor groups, with affiliative behavior such as allogrooming observed between females.",
